blem is they're both grounded. Chelsea and Adam will do whatever it takes to get their mom Lynette out of the house, even if it includes a chance meeting with a very mysterious man. Everything seems to go according to plan until their little brother Taylor realizes that this stranger might be a vampire.\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1354627,\"title\":\"SpongeBob SquarePants: Kreepaway Kamp\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aUOCmqkbCX94znDJNtSy1402Sie.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aFDYcmwEWRiEh58Ri1tMpCUWPBp.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"While at Kamp Koral for a reunion, SpongeBob and the gang are stalked by a mysterious figure lurking in the shadows as campers start disappearing one by one!\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Family\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":17305,\"title\":\"Billy & Mandy's Big Boogey Adventure\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nMWGHdVUrGQwo1SQ4JdDUv556L8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ul2wwmdczRdwL0wFYlYD363oYJ4.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When the Boogey Man causes Grim to lose his powers, rank, and title in the Underworld Court for misusing his powers, he plots to seek out Horror's Hand and take over the world. It's up to Billy, Mandy, Irwin, and Grim to get to Horror's Hand before the Boogey Man does.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Comedy\",\"Animation\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":40617,\"title\":\"Abhiyum Naanum\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5shSpO2q7FmO5FJLmWsveQP3XHc.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cc3B8hCzBma7TFEdr44RNphn6cf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Raghuraman, father of a grown daughter meets Sudhakar, father of a toddler at a playground. Raghuraman recounts the story of his own relationship with his daughter through the years, including his difficulties with accepting her marriage.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21935,\"title\":\"The Haunting Hour: Don't Think About It\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jqQfKmqR2qXjEjJ2F0cH5DbwIGv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ax6ZseXXe26LL9VjKzXf529zHfr.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Cassie, a 13 year old Gothic girl, is trying to fit in at her new school. To entertain herself, she plays a series of pranks on the popular kids and her younger brother, Max. When she goes to a Halloween store looking for new tricks, she finds a little book called \\\"The Evil Thing\\\"\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"TV Movie\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":21597,\"title\":\"Elvira's Haunted Hills\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/woQR7BvgP8ZfuUrUg5bFQKNRRmv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4oux2eoW5hI6uAWpKfFBGM1JSej.jpg\",\"rating\":5.5,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The setting is Carpathia. The year is 1851. When Elvira gets kicked out of an Inn for a slight monetary discrepancy, she is rescued by a local who takes her to stay at the castle in the hills high above the village. The fact that she happens to resemble the count's former \\\"missing\\\" wife opens a can of worms or two.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Horror\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1255047,\"title\":\"Money Making Morons\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gYnUwX3VXP85cnl619i7oWYNKEn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4HRRacsRrIxG5UpiB6qVtmnJ3X0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\\\"God watches out for dummies. He's got both eyes on them.\\\"  Anyone who is young at heart and loves to laugh will enjoy this off-the-wall, melodramatic-styled comedy. Jack and Milo, both in their forties, with about the same IQ, are left to fend for themselves for the first time. They get a loan from the bank and lend the money to the Mafia for big interest. As the Morons go to collect their first interest, their dream of easy money becomes a nightmare. The Mafia demands $500 every week or their lives. They try one money making scheme after another to dodge death. Their only hope is that their stupidity will save them.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1648370,\"title\":\"Leili’s Photo\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jdxmdytsp7AE9Ynd8y6SSNnel6f.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/97tvxGtXumCUDcH2SRcHrv5GB40.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Eight-year-old Leili needs to take a pinhole picture of her family for school the next day, but her family will not cooperate.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"cDmGHalUdZU\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}